add(22,'Independent motion-coordinate count','A six-DOF arm is mounted on a two-DOF gantry; if all eight coordinates are independent, how many configuration coordinates does the combined model use?', ['8','6','2','12'],0,'Under the explicit independence assumption, configuration-coordinate counts add: six arm coordinates plus two gantry coordinates.', ['6 + 2 = 8.','Six counts only the arm.','Two counts only the gantry.','Multiplying 6 by 2 does not count independent configuration coordinates.'],typ='numerical',assumptions=['All arm and gantry coordinates are independent; no extra loop constraint is imposed.','This counts configuration coordinates, not a claim of eight independent Cartesian pose coordinates.'],steps=['Count six independent arm coordinates.','Add two independent gantry coordinates: 6 + 2 = 8.'],formulas=[{'expression':'n_total = n_arm + n_gantry','variables':{'n_total':'combined independent configuration-coordinate count','n_arm':'arm count','n_gantry':'gantry count'},'units':{'n_total':'dimensionless','n_arm':'dimensionless','n_gantry':'dimensionless'},'assumptions':['Independent coordinates; no additional coupling constraint.']}])
